}
__syncthreads();
```
sw written by warps before this sync. sv unchanged. **OK.**

Hmm, all the geqr2 barriers look present. Let me look at the **V-emit and panel write-back and T-formation** section — that's after the loop:

```
// emit V
float* Vbase = ...;
for (idx=tid; idx<BL*BIB; ...) Vbase[idx] = ...sA...;   // reads sA, writes global V
// write panel back to H
